### ==============================================================================
### OU Results Distributed System - HTTP Request Collection
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client extension, IntelliJ HTTP Client, & Postman
### ==============================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8081
@readServiceUrl = http://localhost:8082
@ingestionUrl = http://localhost:3000
@eurekaUrl = http://localhost:8761
@rabbitMqApi = http://localhost:15672/api
@adminApiKey = test-admin-key-change-in-production

# Known College Prefixes:
# Shard 1: 1604, 1605, 1606, 1607
# Shard 2: 1608, 1609, 1610, 1611, 1612
@rollShard1 = 160423733001
@rollShard2 = 160823733001
@rollNonExistent = 160423733999
@rollInvalidFormat = 16042373
@rollUnknownCollege = 999923733001


### ==============================================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS & DISCOVERY
### ==============================================================================

### Gateway Health & Status
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Eureka Server Apps Registry
GET {{eurekaUrl}}/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### Direct Read Service Health (Instance 1)
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Direct Ingestion Service Health
GET {{ingestionUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Ingestion Service Memory Metrics
GET {{ingestionUrl}}/admin/metrics/memory
Accept: application/json

### RabbitMQ Overview (Credentials: guest / guest)
GET {{rabbitMqApi}}/overview
Authorization: Basic guest guest
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 2. STUDENT RESULT LOOKUPS (READ PATH VIA GATEWAY)
### ==============================================================================

### [Read Shard 1] Lookup student result (College 1604 -> Routed to Shard 1)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/results/{{rollShard1}}
Accept: application/json

### [Read Shard 2] Lookup student result (College 1608 -> Routed to Shard 2)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/results/{{rollShard2}}
Accept: application/json

### [Negative Caching] Lookup non-existent student (Returns empty data, cached in Redis)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/results/{{rollNonExistent}}
Accept: application/json

### [Edge Rejection] Malformed roll number (Not 12 digits -> HTTP 400 at Gateway)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/results/{{rollInvalidFormat}}
Accept: application/json

### [Edge Rejection] Unknown college code (College 9999 -> HTTP 400 at Gateway)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/results/{{rollUnknownCollege}}
Accept: application/json

### [Direct Query] Bypass Gateway -> Query Read Service Directly on Port 8082
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/api/results/{{rollShard1}}
Accept: application/json

### [Circuit Breaker Fallback] Direct check of gateway fallback route
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/fallback/read
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 3. ADMIN WRITE PATH (INGESTION & PERSISTENCE)
### ==============================================================================

### [Admin Upload] Upload CSV Results Batch via Gateway
# Note: For VS Code REST Client, place file in scratch/test_upload.csv or adjust path.
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/admin/results/upload
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

July-August 2026 Regular Examinations
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resultDate"

2026-08-15
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="upload-sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../load-tests/seed/out/upload-sample.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### [Unauthorized Upload] Upload without Admin API Key (Expect HTTP 401)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/admin/results/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Unauthorized Test
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### [Direct Ingestion Upload] Bypass Gateway -> Upload Directly to Ingestion Service (Port 3000)
POST {{ingestionUrl}}/admin/results/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Direct Ingestion Upload Test
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resultDate"

2026-08-15
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

exam_id,roll_no,semester,college_code,batch_year,dept_code,name,father_name,gender,course,medium,subjects,result_status,sgpa,cgpa
EXAM_MANUAL_01,160423733901,6,1604,23,733,TEST STUDENT 1,PARENT 1,MALE,B.E. (AICTE),ENGLISH,"[{""code"":""CS601"",""name"":""SYSTEMS"",""credits"":3,""grade"":""A""}]",PASSED,8.50,8.10
EXAM_MANUAL_01,160823733901,6,1608,23,733,TEST STUDENT 2,PARENT 2,FEMALE,B.E. (AICTE),ENGLISH,"[{""code"":""CS601"",""name"":""SYSTEMS"",""credits"":3,""grade"":""S""}]",PASSED,9.50,9.20
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### ==============================================================================
### 4. MONITORING, CACHE METRICS & CIRCUIT BREAKERS
### ==============================================================================

### Read Service Cache Hit Count
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/cache.gets?tag=name:result&tag=result:hit
Accept: application/json

### Read Service Cache Miss Count
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/cache.gets?tag=name:result&tag=result:miss
Accept: application/json

### Shard 1 Circuit Breaker Call Counts (DB Queries)
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/resilience4j.circuitbreaker.calls?tag=name:shard1Database
Accept: application/json

### Shard 2 Circuit Breaker Call Counts (DB Queries)
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/resilience4j.circuitbreaker.calls?tag=name:shard2Database
Accept: application/json

### Gateway Circuit Breaker State (readService)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/actuator/circuitbreakers
Accept: application/json

### Read Service HikariCP Active Connections
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/hikaricp.connections.active
Accept: application/json

### Read Service HikariCP Pending Connections
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/actuator/metrics/hikaricp.connections.pending
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 5. RABBITMQ QUEUE STATUS & MONITORING
### ==============================================================================

### Check results.write Queue Status (Pending Messages & Consumers)
GET {{rabbitMqApi}}/queues/%2F/results.write
Authorization: Basic guest guest
Accept: application/json

### Check Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ) Status
GET {{rabbitMqApi}}/queues/%2F/results.write.dlq
Authorization: Basic guest guest
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### 6. EXAM PUBLISHING & REPLICATION (PHASE 5 SAGA)
### ==============================================================================

### [Publish Exam] Trigger Exam Publishing via Gateway (Ingestion -> RabbitMQ results.publish)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/admin/exams/EXAM_MANUAL_01/publish
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### [Publish Status] Check Multi-Shard Publish Saga Status via Gateway (Routed to Persistence)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/admin/exams/EXAM_MANUAL_01/publish-status
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### [Direct Publish Trigger] Bypass Gateway -> Trigger Publishing on Ingestion Service (Port 3000)
POST {{ingestionUrl}}/admin/exams/EXAM_MANUAL_01/publish
Accept: application/json

### [Direct Publish Status] Bypass Gateway -> Query Persistence Service Directly (Port 8085)
GET http://localhost:8085/admin/exams/EXAM_MANUAL_01/publish-status
Accept: application/json

### [Internal Strong-Read] Read Primary Shard Directly (Bypasses Replica & Cache)
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/internal/results/{{rollShard1}}?consistency=strong
Accept: application/json

### [Internal Strong-Read via Shard 2] Read Primary Shard 2 Directly
GET {{readServiceUrl}}/internal/results/{{rollShard2}}?consistency=strong
Accept: application/json

### [Security Check] Attempt Internal Strong-Read via Gateway (Must return 404 / Not Routed)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/internal/results/{{rollShard1}}?consistency=strong
Accept: application/json

